{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrHjV4K3MYvk6d5vvnVv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The solution is in `benchmark/solution.ail`. I ran it with IO and FS and it prints exactly `Order: Widget = $60`, which matches the expected output.\n\n- **`calculateTotal`** is a `pure func` that returns `price * quantity`.\n- **`readPrice`** declares `! {FS}`. It reads the file, trims it and parses the number. If the text isn't a number it falls back to `0`.\n- **`displayOrder`** declares `! {IO}` and builds the line with `concat`, so the literal `$` doesn't get mixed up with `${...}` interpolation.\n- **`processOrder`** declares `! {IO, FS}`. It calls one FS function, one pure function and one IO function, so it needs both effects.\n- **`main`** writes `\"15\"` to `widget_price.txt`, then calls `processOrder(\"Widget\", \"widget_price.txt\", 4)`.\n\nMy first write to the file was an incomplete draft that never ran. I replaced it before running anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1681,"cache_read_input_tokens":51914,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1681},"output_tokens":328,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"952cb811-17b9-4924-a961-a4e47384f14d","uuid":"0ad612c9-d5f8-4777-9d63-ee8e1a4434ed","timestamp":"2026-10-09T07:44:00.670Z","request_id":"req_011CfrHjUnBte4BhxqLYNb4Z"}
